sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Player
    participant C as Component.razor
    participant H as Typed HttpClient
    participant B as BFF Cookie Auth
    participant E as Minimal API Handler
    participant S as Table Storage

    U->>C: Tap Submit score
    C->>C: Client validate
    alt Invalid
        C-->>U: Inline error
    else Valid
        C->>H: POST /api/leaderboard
        H->>B: Cookie auth check
        alt Unauth
            B-->>H: 401
            H-->>C: Auth error
        else Auth
            B->>E: Forward to handler
            E->>S: UPSERT
            alt Transient
                S-->>E: 503 Retry-After
                E-->>H: retry via Polly
            else Ok
                S-->>E: 200 entity
                E-->>H: 200 DTO
                H-->>C: Update view model
                C-->>U: New rank
            end
        end
    end